WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.214
Welcome to Module 1 of the Azure
Security Engineering learning path:

2
00:00:04.214 --> 00:00:06.625
the baseline and the exposure register.

3
00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:09.138
A landing zone decides
what can be deployed.

4
00:00:09.138 --> 00:00:12.815
It doesn't decide what the internet
can reach, and nothing later in

5
00:00:12.815 --> 00:00:16.424
this path can be proved complete
without a list of what's exposed.

6
00:00:16.424 --> 00:00:21.198
In this module you learn how the Azure
Security Engineering implementation guide is

7
00:00:21.198 --> 00:00:25.635
put together, add the security settings
the baseline needs on top of the landing

8
00:00:25.635 --> 00:00:29.937
zone, and build the exposure register
that every later module checks against.

9
00:00:29.937 --> 00:00:34.244
It covers Steps 1 and 2 of the guide,
and takes about fifty minutes,

10
00:00:34.244 --> 00:00:36.980
plus a lab in your own test subscription.
